From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KB <kb@kb-rpcs3.example>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 05:04:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: sparsely trace guest queue, host waits and Vulkan frame path

Capture 1-in-32 guest display-queue wall-time epochs in a fixed-size
atomic event ring, drain on the watchdog only. Record guest PPU event
queue, event flag and semaphore waits longer than 500 us, RSX present,
Vulkan queue submit, swapchain acquire/present and host fence waits.
Retain the profiler-OFF build and existing FPS reports. These are
CPU-side timestamps; no GPU execution timestamps or true frame DAG.
A report explicitly counts overwritten/missed events.

---
